+    // path. Target apps (Unity WebGL, older itch.io HTML5 games) never
+    // exercise wasm-gc array.fill, so this crash is a policy guardrail
+    // against silent misbehaviour, not a runtime path expected to fire.
+    FATAL(
+        "DrumBrake: wasm-GC ref array.fill unsupported under PC-off "
+        "(switch-v8 #74)");
